APPLY ORDER MATTERS
  `referral-service` enables `billing-service`, and `polar-billing-events`
  enables `billing-service` + `ai-usage-retention`. Cargo resolves feature
  order internally, but the `src/utils/mod.rs` module lines below must all be
  present or the gated modules are simply absent (no compile error, which is
  worse — the feature would silently build nothing).

